WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.458 --> 00:00:04.379
I think I said to him the
first time that I walked into this just

00:00:06.881 --> 00:00:10.719
I don't know what it is about this
this job

00:00:11.052 --> 00:00:14.055
or this calling to be a storyteller,

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:17.684
but I know every time

00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:19.144
I come into it with me

00:00:19.144 --> 00:00:22.856
and then I leave and something's
different, something's changed,

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:25.692
and it's hard to necessarily
say what that is,

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:30.071
but every single person here,
the heart that you've put into it,

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:33.283
it's completely changed me
as a human being.

00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:38.413
I feel like I have a home here,
which I'll be back to quite a bit.

00:00:41.499 --> 00:00:46.046
And I've said it to several of you too
in conversation,

00:00:46.046 --> 00:00:49.966
it's not since I was a teenager

00:00:50.425 --> 00:00:54.012
renting out basement
spaces in art galleries

00:00:54.012 --> 00:00:57.640
just making sh*t with my friends
for the sake of doing it

00:00:58.058 --> 00:01:01.144
have I felt such equal

00:01:01.436 --> 00:01:05.607
and open and loving collaboration
and craftsmanship,

00:01:06.816 --> 00:01:09.235
which is something

00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:11.654
something pretty remarkable at this level

00:01:11.654 --> 00:01:14.657
because this is this is a first for me.

00:01:14.949 --> 00:01:19.204
But yeah,
I believe in every storyteller here.

00:01:19.204 --> 00:01:21.247
I believe in every craftsperson
here. I believe

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:23.958
in every beating heart and soul here.

00:01:23.958 --> 00:01:25.043
This is really special.

00:01:25.043 --> 00:01:28.213
Thank you all so much
for bringing everything to this.

00:01:28.546 --> 00:01:31.091
And I'll remember it forever.

00:01:31.091 --> 00:01:33.426
And we'll all have it forever.

00:01:33.426 --> 00:01:33.927
Thank you.

00:01:33.927 --> 00:01:35.095
Thank you, guys.

00:01:49.359 --> 00:01:50.026
Thank you all.

